# 🎨 PAPERPULSE MASTER DESIGN SYSTEM SPECIFICATION (PRD)
### *Soft 3D Claymorphism & Modern Tactile SaaS Design Standard*
**Document Version:** 1.0.0 | **Last Updated:** September 2026  
**Master Authority Link:** Referenced & Enforced in [brain.md](file:///d:/adsense/brain.md)

---

## 🏛️ 1. DESIGN PHILOSOPHY & AESTHETIC LAWS

PaperPulse is an ultra-premium, privacy-first web document utility suite. The visual language bridges **Soft 3D Claymorphism** with **Linear / Apple Vision-Grade SaaS Cleanliness**:

1. **Light Theme Supremacy:** Crisp, clean, trustworthy porcelain surfaces (`#F8FAFC` to `#FFFFFF`) paired with soft ambient pastel glows (subtle violet, sky, and mint radial auras).
2. **Tactile Physicality (Claymorphism):** Elements do not look like flat digital stickers. They feel like physical, soft-molded tactile objects with double-layered outer ambient shadows and bright inner white bevels (`inset 0 1px 1px #FFFFFF`).
3. **Aerodynamic & Un-cluttered:** No bulky, chunky, or 2-line wrapped text blocks in navigation. All interfaces must prioritize breathing room, widescreen layouts (`max-w-[1520px]`), and crisp typographic hierarchy.
4. **Zero-Lag 60 FPS Performance:** All micro-animations and bouncy spring physics MUST be hardware-accelerated using GPU primitives (`transform: translate3d`, `will-change: transform`).

---

## 🎨 2. CORE COLOR PALETTE & SEMANTIC TOKENS

### **A. Neutral Canvas & Surfaces**
* **Page Canvas Background:** `#F8FAFC` (Slate-50) with ambient fixed radial gradients:
  ```css
  background-image: 
    radial-gradient(circle at 10% 12%, rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.06) 0%, transparent 45%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 90% 80%, rgba(2, 132, 199, 0.06) 0%, transparent 45%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 50% 45%, rgba(5, 150, 105, 0.03) 0%, transparent 50%);
  ```
* **Bento Card Surface:** `#FFFFFF` (Pure White)
* **Secondary Surface / Shells:** `#F1F5F9` (Slate-100)
* **Subtle Structural Borders:** `#E2E8F0` (Slate-200) / `rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.9)`

### **B. Typography & Readability Palette**
* **Primary Headings (H1, H2):** `#0F172A` (Obsidian Slate 900) - Font: `Space Grotesk`, Extrabold
* **Section Subtitles (H3, H4):** `#1E293B` (Slate 800) - Font: `Space Grotesk`, Bold
* **Body / Paragraphs:** `#334155` to `#475569` (Slate 700/600) - Font: `Plus Jakarta Sans`, Medium
* **Metadata / Timestamps / Labels:** `#64748B` (Slate 500) - Font: `Plus Jakarta Sans` or Monospace

### **C. Vibrantly Curated SaaS Accents**
| Role | Primary Color | Soft Pastel BG | Border Accent | Use Case |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **Brand Primary** | `#7C3AED` (Violet-600) | `#F5F3FF` (Violet-50) | `#DDD6FE` (Violet-200) | Hero buttons, logo accent, active links |
| **Security & Success** | `#059669` (Emerald-600) | `#ECFDF5` (Emerald-50) | `#A7F3D0` (Emerald-200) | "100% In-Browser" badges, download success cards |
| **Action & Target** | `#0284C7` (Sky-600) | `#F0F9FF` (Sky-50) | `#BAE6FD` (Sky-200) | File size presets (100KB/200KB), compression |
| **High Speed & Extraction** | `#E11D48` (Rose-600) | `#FFF1F2` (Rose-50) | `#FECDD3` (Rose-200) | Page extraction, deletion buttons, error alerts |
| **Resolution & Presets** | `#D97706` (Amber-600) | `#FFFBEB` (Amber-50) | `#FDE68A` (Amber-200) | 300 DPI canvas toggles, image format pills |

